# {{name}}

A game on the engine at {{engine_repo}} (release {{engine_version}}, pinned in
`cmake/engine.cmake`).

```sh
make test           # build, every test and every lab at its smoke flags
make agents-check   # the repo against the engine's rules
make lab LAB=run    # the simulation over seeds, with a captioned picture in previews/run/
```

Agents start at [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md).
